sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant E as Executor
    participant T as run_sql
    participant M as Monitor
    participant R as Recovery
    U->>E: Show the order_id and total of the 5 most recent orders
    E->>T: SELECT order_id, SUM(...) with no table alias
    T-->>M: Error: ambiguous column name: order_id
    M->>R: failure, type schema
    R->>R: retrieve 3 sections from the error guide
    R->>E: give every table an alias (2 retries left)
    E->>T: SELECT o.order_id, SUM(...) with no GROUP BY
    T-->>M: 1 row, runs without error
    Note over M: SUM next to a plain column and no GROUP BY: quarantined
    M->>R: failure, type no_group_by
    R->>E: add GROUP BY o.order_id (1 retry left)
    E->>T: corrected query
    T-->>M: 5 rows
    M->>E: result looks fine
    E->>M: final answer
    M->>U: answer matches the rows
